B.u115. {"problem": "The request says the owner names a deputy who approves while the owner is away. Nothing models this. There is no action to name or revoke a deputy, no field recording who the deputy is, and no 'owner away' condition. Any holder of the deputy role can approve at any time, whether or not the owner has named them or is away. The description's wording about the deputy the owner has named is not enforced anywhere.", "where": "authoring.domain.yaml: actions.approve_commit (actor, description)", "kind": "behaviour", "from": "llm"}
