B.u125. {"problem": "The change request says the owner names a deputy who approves while they are away, but nothing models naming a deputy or being away. There is no action, property or link for it. The new `deputy` role is simply added to `approve_commit`'s actors, so a deputy can approve at any time, whether or not the owner named them or is away. The description text claims a constraint that the declaration does not enforce.", "where": "authoring.domain.yaml, actions.approve_commit (actor, description) and roles", "kind": "other", "from": "llm"}
