B.u112. {"problem": "A deputy can now approve a commit, but 'deliver' is still owner-only. The handoff sends approver: actor.id to Delivery, whose only role is 'approver' with world actor ana. Approving while away therefore does not carry through to delivery, and the deputy has no place in Delivery's roles. The request does not say whether this is intended.", "where": "authoring.domain.yaml actions.deliver and handoffs.deliver_approved_commit; delivery.domain.yaml roles", "kind": "reference", "from": "llm"}
B.u19. {"domain": "authoring", "check": "log_replay", "severity": "warning", "where": "E-requested-record_probes@1", "problem": "propose_element at 2026-11-07T06:34:11.430464+00:00 would now set ['permission'] differently", "carried": false, "from": "compiler"}
