B.u106. {"problem": "The approver id travels to Delivery through the handoff, but Delivery's world only knows `approver: ana`. Delivery's `approver` role never mentions a deputy. A commit approved by a deputy is delivered only by the owner (`deliver` is owner-only), so the deputy's approval cannot carry through the whole flow. Whether Delivery's own deploy approver should include the deputy is not addressed.", "where": "authoring.domain.yaml: handoffs.deliver_approved_commit (approver: actor.id), actions.deliver; delivery.domain.yaml: roles/world.actors", "kind": "behaviour", "from": "llm"}
